Package: bibit-filesearch-plugin
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Bibit frontend plugin for bibit-filesearch
 Provides the file-search management page inside Bibit (features group),
 backed by the standalone bibit-filesearch service. Installs the signed
 plugin bundle to /usr/lib/bibit/plugins where Bibit auto-discovers and
 activates it at startup.
